Description: control center for the Logitech G13 gaming keypad
 Configure three independent Logitech G13 mapping profiles, monitor the
 keypad and thumbstick, and emit mapped controls through a system-wide Linux
 virtual keyboard and gamepad that work with GNOME, X11, Wayland, and games.
